{"content":[{"c":["SEA OF GLASS"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["A body of water in the vision of heaven described by John in the book of Revelation (",{"href":"?bref=Rev.4.6","r":"Rev.4.6","rawR":"Rev.4.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Rev.4.6","value":"Rev.4.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"Rv 4:6"},"). It appears again later, in a different vision (",{"href":"?bref=Rev.15.2","r":"Rev.15.2","rawR":"Rev.15.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Rev.15.2","value":"Rev.15.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"15:2"},"), and is perhaps connected with other “sea” references in the same book (",{"href":"?bref=Rev.13.1","r":"Rev.13.1","rawR":"Rev.13.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Rev.13.1","value":"Rev.13.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"13:1"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Rev.21.1","r":"Rev.21.1","rawR":"Rev.21.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Rev.21.1","value":"Rev.21.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"21:1"},"). It probably depicts the vast expanse before God’s throne. The crystal clearness of this sea may symbolize that everything is translucent and revealed in the presence of God."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"SeaofGlass","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Rv 4:6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Rev.4.6","rawQueryValue":"Rev.4.6","sourceRefExact":"Rev.4.6"},{"anchorText":"15:2","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Rev.15.2","rawQueryValue":"Rev.15.2","sourceRefExact":"Rev.15.2"},{"anchorText":"13:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Rev.13.1","rawQueryValue":"Rev.13.1","sourceRefExact":"Rev.13.1"},{"anchorText":"21:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Rev.21.1","rawQueryValue":"Rev.21.1","sourceRefExact":"Rev.21.1"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"a8c410c63448d7adef78b28ec4a63bdc44f40aee2bd5a7447ef35802c9ad1a6e","sourceItemName":"SeaofGlass","sourceItemOrder":110,"sourceMember":"Articles/S.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"SeaofGlass","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Sea of Glass","title":"Sea of Glass","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}